| Page | Owns | Explicitly Does NOT Own |
|---|---|---|
| / (modified) | Existing root landing content; rendering inside AppLayout | Notification data; unread-count state; preferences; navigation chrome (AppLayout owns chrome); auth/session (AppHeader owns the gate) |
| /notifications (new) | Notification list display; pagination cursor; per-row mark-as-read trigger; mark-all-as-read trigger; list loading/empty/error states; link to preferences | Preferences; unread-count badge state (NotificationIndicator owns display, NotificationSyncService owns data); navigation chrome; session/auth |
| /notifications/preferences (new) | Category listing; draft toggle state; save action; save success/error feedback | Notification list; unread count; navigation chrome; session/auth |

