**Ready for Review:** YES
**Readiness reason:** The F-022 notification surface integrates cleanly into the minimal existing scaffold: two new authenticated pages plus the existing root route gain a new application layout and header indicator surface, all six notification APIs map to a single client sync service reused atop the existing API client, the single authenticated-session permission gate is declared for routes and components, and every new component is justified against verified codebase evidence with concrete rejection reasons.
